    function testRegression_property() public {
        // Owner makes a call that triggers fallback (send to self so that fallback is called and msg.sender != owner, but here we just need any call with value to a contract address that has no receive)
        // Actually, sendMoney sends value to _target via call, which triggers fallback if _target is a contract with no receive. Use a fresh contract that has no receive.
